---
/**
 * Workbench Principle Callout Component
 * Editorial callout defining the experimental philosophy of the Engineering Lab.
 */
---

<aside class="workbench-principle-shell" aria-labelledby="principle-heading">
  <div class="principle-accent-bar" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="principle-content">
    <div class="principle-header">
      <div class="principle-badge">
        <svg class="principle-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z" />
        </svg>
        <span id="principle-heading" class="principle-eyebrow">THE WORKBENCH PRINCIPLE</span>
      </div>
      <span class="principle-tag">EMPIRICAL RIGOR</span>
    </div>

    <p class="principle-quote">
      "Not every experiment needs to become a production product. Some exist to isolate algorithmic edge cases, measure memory versus stationarity trade-offs, probe async runtime failures, or stress-test state machine guardrails. Inconclusive and completed explorations are documented with equal technical transparency."
    </p>

    <div class="principle-meta">
      <div class="meta-item">
        <span class="meta-dot"></span>
        <span>Hypothesis-Driven</span>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-item">
        <span class="meta-dot"></span>
        <span>Evidence-Grounded</span>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-item">
        <span class="meta-dot"></span>
        <span>Non-Commercial Sandboxes</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</aside>

<style>
  .workbench-principle-shell {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--color-surface-elevated, rgba(16, 26, 23, 0.75));
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border, rgba(246, 241, 232, 0.09));
    border-radius: 0.875rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    display: flex;
  }

  .principle-accent-bar {
    width: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--color-accent, #7ed8c4) 0%, rgba(126, 216, 196, 0.3) 100%);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .principle-content {
    padding: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .principle-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .principle-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .principle-icon {
    width: 1rem;
    height: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-accent, #7ed8c4);
  }

  .principle-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-accent, #7ed8c4);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .principle-tag {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-muted, #83968e);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(246, 241, 232, 0.08);
  }

  .principle-quote {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary, #a9b8b1);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .principle-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(246, 241, 232, 0.06);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    color: var(--color-text-muted, #83968e);
  }

  .meta-item {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .meta-dot {
    width: 5px;
    height: 5px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-accent, #7ed8c4);
  }

  /* ==========================================================================
     LIGHT THEME STYLING
     ========================================================================== */
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .workbench-principle-shell,
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .workbench-principle-shell {
    background: #ffffff !important;
    border: 1px solid rgba(20, 31, 28, 0.12) !important;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(20, 31, 28, 0.05) !important;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .principle-accent-bar,
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .principle-accent-bar {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0d7663 0%, rgba(13, 118, 99, 0.3) 100%) !important;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .principle-eyebrow,
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .principle-eyebrow,
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .principle-icon,
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .principle-icon {
    color: #0d7663 !important;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .principle-tag,
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .principle-tag {
    background: rgba(20, 31, 28, 0.04) !important;
    border-color: rgba(20, 31, 28, 0.1) !important;
    color: #35453f !important;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .principle-quote,
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .principle-quote {
    color: #35453f !important;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .principle-meta,
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .principle-meta {
    border-top-color: rgba(20, 31, 28, 0.08) !important;
    color: #4e6059 !important;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .meta-dot,
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .meta-dot {
    background: #0d7663 !important;
  }
</style>
